WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.140
Okay? Okay?

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.310
But...

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.570
Please!

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.650
I still don't...

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.530
You were so excited about it just a while ago!

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.760
Ah, rather than talk about this,

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:15.410
you're going to the festival in front of the station this weekend, right?

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:17.580
Gosh! Don't change the subject!

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.540
Good luck, then!

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.230
Thanks!

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:28.410
Here's everything those three got for us.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.880
We have 32% now.

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.130
38% remaining... a very tough situation for us...

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.980
Look, turn around now

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:53.320
but things like chances won't be there anymore.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:57.780
That's what some people will tell you,

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:04.040
but there are just times when you can't move at all.

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:13.510
Yes, everything I say

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:17.970
is for your sake.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.470
Sorry, but

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:22.770
I won't consent easily

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:28.650
to things I don't accept.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:35.650
Even if I can get by that moment with a lie

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:38.740
I'll end up regretting it afterwards.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.530
Whether it's the past or the future

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:43.620
or, of course, the present,

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:48.040
I am the one that has to shoulder it.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:52.710
You'll understand the meaning to everything afterwards.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:51.340
So let's worry!

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:56.970
even if you don't understand them now,

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:01.640
whether it has to do with pain, fortune or secrets.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:06.020
So don't cry, let's hold each other as we go

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.520
forever-

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:15.280
It's My Life

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:15.280
because it's my life.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:13.980
last frame of Manabi Straight! logo

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.150
Hurry, hurry!

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:21.000
The scrap show is
about to start!

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.340
I know!

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:30.190
Okay, let's get started.

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:31.300
Begin!

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:32.340
More, more!

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:33.220
More!

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:45.150
The reconstruction of the grand clock had started.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:51.360
Depending on its mood for the day, it could be slow, or it could be fast.

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:55.540
That was how bad this 82-year-old grand clock had become.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:00.330
With the Aikoh merger imminent,

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:02.830
it was to be replaced with a new state-of-the-art clock.

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:09.530
When we heard of the news,
we didn't feel anything special.

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.470
But...

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:14.980
Let's go...

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:16.630
Yeah.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.220
Fellow students of Seioh,

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:39.000
can you hear my voice?

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:40.460
W-Wait a minute!

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:45.400
I am the clock fairy.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:49.380
I have watched over this school for 82 years.

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:52.550
I am a very fortunate clock,

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:57.620
for I was able to watch everyone's energetic forms for a very long time.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:03.550
But even a clock like me has now run out of time.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.760
I will now pass away to the land where clocks go to after they are finished with their jobs.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.180
That time has come.

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:11.650
I have but one regret.

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:15.410
I wanted to see a School Fair one more time.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:18.740
I wanted to see all of you happy.

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:22.260
It might be too much to ask for a clock like me,

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:25.460
but... but if it's possible,

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:30.360
could you all sign the School Fair revival petition?

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:33.260
Cut! Cut!

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:35.930
Ah, poor, poor clock...

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:40.340
Like I said, not that one!

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.310
This one, this one!

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:44.970
Gosh, what a cheap tear-jerking act.

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:50.690
Th-The clock fairy... H-How tragic...

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:52.490
Uhh...

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:56.570
Gosh, it's clear that people that believe in fairies are in the minority!

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:57.450
Besides...

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:02.450
But, there might really have been a fairy.

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:13.430
This must have been divine punishment.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:25.930
Hello?

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.480
Like I said!

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:29.670
Divine punishment took place!

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:43.020
Wow, it's a miracle that only this room got affected.

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.080
Really,

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:47.810
there's no other way to explain this
but supernatural forces having a part in this.

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:49.510
Thank God, thank God!

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:52.420
Thank you for your help.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.460
Well, basically.

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:56.150
How should I put it...

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:58.510
You have my sincerest sympathy.

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:53.240
Ah, there you are.

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:04.880
Heck, where are we?

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:07.240
A-Aokigahara Forest?

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:11.460
Well, it's been a long time since people last used it.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.330
Ah, this way, this way.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:20.300
Here, over here.

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:32.120
Seioh School Dormitory.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:34.920
It's a building from the years when Seioh was still a boarding school,

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.900
so it probably hasn't been used for at least thirty years.

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:39.270
Rejoice,

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:41.900
because they're going to scrap this place next April at the time of the merger,

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.820
you can use this however you want.

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:48.710
Man, it was tough to get permission for this.

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:51.260
I really wanted to see your happy faces,

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:53.620
so I personally asked the principal...

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:58.590
Hey!

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:01.910
You guys have to accept this!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:04.050
This is the only place free!

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:05.170
No!!!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.160
This place is so scary!!!

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:08.100
This is divine punishment!

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:11.580
Manabi-chan, this has to be divine punishment!

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:30.290
This was a true story that took place thirty-five years ago.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:34.720
There was a female student named Kamiya Reiko.

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:38.640
She was having problems in love,

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:45.450
and the path she took after
she saw things clearly in the world...

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:08.740
...was a romantic happy ending.

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:10.280
Wonderful, wonderful.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.710
What was that story for?

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:17.400
I just realized...

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:20.050
For what you did last time, are you in the clear now?

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:23.180
I have been released without penalty thanks to super-regulatory measures.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.500
If you need us, please come to 2-A
and ask for Amamiya Manami!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.500
We're waiting
for your petitions, too!

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:33.470
We really don't know where to start with this place...

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:40.620
Let's start with the brooms.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:41.780
No objections.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:12.190
Let's go home before the sun sets.

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:16.360
But... I want to get back to
gathering petitions tomorrow...

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:19.470
So I'd like us to at least get this place ready.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:22.320
It's going to be pitch dark
since we don't have electricity here yet.

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:26.900
I knew this was going to happen...

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:31.200
The second floor is so dark and really, really frightening!

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:34.940
Y-Yeah... flashlights wouldn't help too much.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:38.040
Why don't we ask the thespian club for helpers?

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:40.330
Ah, but...

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:43.080
...let's just do this by ourselves...

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:46.590
Right.

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:49.240
We can't really ask for their help in this situation.

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:04.930
The School Fair that everyone takes part in will be so fun!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.890
It will be so much better than
the festival in front of the station!

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.960
Why doesn't everyone understand this?!

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.630
Gosh...

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:18.820
"The School Fair that everyone
takes part in will be so fun," eh?

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.000
That is should be clear and obvious!

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:23.330
Everyone should know that!

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:25.960
You think so?

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:34.050
A while ago, I probably wouldn't have understood something "should be fun" even if you told me.

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:38.330
I understand it now.

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:42.730
That's because I know the fun in working with friends in an activity.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:52.570
"From friends to buddies
I thought that was the best catch phrase,

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:55.060
but we're the only ones that understand the meaning of that,

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.130
and it might not have reached everyone else.

00:11:58.590 --> 00:11:59.950
Mei-chan...

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:07.000
Ah, there you are.

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:16.120
What are you going to do now?

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:17.040
Nothing really.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.780
How about some donuts in front of the station?

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:20.080
Yeah...

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:23.170
Huh?

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:24.010
What's the matter?

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:25.280
Look at this.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:27.050
Hurry, hurry!

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:28.730
Everyone's starving!

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:41.450
But man, this place has got the old look.

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:44.050
This is bad, this is bad!

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:47.410
This will require an incomparable job compared to our previous renovation.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.550
Hey, over here, over here!

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:50.960
Let's get started!

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.020
And?

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:58.630
What's the plan this time?

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:00.320
You got any blueprints?

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:02.890
N-No, we don't have one yet.

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:03.900
Oh?

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:06.860
Well, it's okay. Decide on one soon.

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:08.700
We're all standing by.

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:20.480
All right!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.990
Let's move everything inside first!

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:26.210
Mei-chan, it wasn't just us!

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:27.010
Yeah!

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:28.620
This is great, right, Manabi?

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:30.920
Manabi?

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:34.510
Manabi?

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:40.140
All right!

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:41.390
Here we go!!!

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:51.430
Everyone, let's do our best!

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:52.860
We have more food coming!

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:55.240
Up next is raspberry pancakes!

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:57.610
All right!!!

00:13:57.610 --> 00:13:58.540
What's this?

00:13:58.540 --> 00:13:59.600
Wh-Who knows...

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.370
Ah, over here!

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:05.050
The new Student Council office that sensei mentioned!

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:07.420
The new Student Council office?

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:11.820
Did I surprise you?

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:13.930
You guys are heading home, right?

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:15.880
We've got some snacks, so why not stop by?

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:18.380
N-No, we're...

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:19.270
Oh?

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:21.860
You didn't come here because you needed something from the Student Council?

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:24.640
I-It's not like that either, but...

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:28.060
Well who cares!

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:29.160
Come on, come on!

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:31.740
W-Wait-

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:33.960
Come on, come on, snacks, snacks!

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:58.760
This place looks completely different now.

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:01.910
Ah, Principal!

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:03.030
It looks wonderful.

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:04.180
Right? Right?

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:06.310
Everyone helped out!

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:30.100
Manabi!

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:32.580
We're going to move those chairs up to the second floor, okay?

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:34.050
Ah, sure!

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:35.070
Please!

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:35.690
Gotcha.

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:37.090
Leave it to us.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:41.140
Be careful; the stairs are pretty dark!

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.610
Sorry for asking you girls, but let's go.

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:45.550
Okay.

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:48.440
Amamiya-san.

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:49.620
Yes?

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:53.100
Do you remember that you said
you'd fall in love with this school...

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:56.900
...when you nominated yourself for Student Council President?

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:59.780
When I nominated myself?

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:03.550
"The miracle where people walk through the same youth."

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:05.780
"Cherry-blossom colored futures fly into the sky."

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:09.120
"When we shine, we shine with our friends."

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:12.250
You thought you'd love this school after hearing the school anthem.

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:14.310
Ah, yes!

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:18.910
I thought you said pretty bold words for
the first day you transferred into the school.

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:24.010
Has the school caused you to fall in love with it?

00:16:25.390 --> 00:16:29.180
Has Seioh made you fall in love with it?

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:35.980
Yes!

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:43.080
Please tell all the students working here...

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:48.320
...to contact their families so that they won't get worried, okay?

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:49.170
Okay!

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:52.040
I'll take care of the lighting, then.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:55.290
There should be a generator in the warehouse-

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:59.640
Ow-ow-ow-ow...

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:01.200
Shimojima-sensei?!

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:04.140
P-Principal?!

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.770
Umm, th-this is... umm...

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:07.970
...not... usage of tools without permission!

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:10.280
I planned on reporting to you eventually,

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:11.860
like casually afterwards...

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:13.090
I mean, properly afterwards.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.230
And umm, the students are working hard, too.

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:20.890
But without lighting, it's really-

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:23.490
G-Ghosts might come out, too, so-

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:25.720
Please, Sensei.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:28.190
Let these girls use the power generator.

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.700
All right! We've got our lighting now!

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.560
Let's get back to work!

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:29.670
Okay!

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.820
Do you have enough people for the cafeteria?

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:33.780
We have too many, actually!

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:36.540
Actually, they're going to start renovating the second floor now,

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:38.400
so go help out there.

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:42.440
Here... goes...

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:53.410
Rumors spread and spread,

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:57.540
and the number of people that came to help kept growing.

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:10.800
Before we knew it,

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:12.690
the renovation involved not just the cafeteria,

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.180
but the whole building.

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:16.790
It covered everywhere we could go.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:40.830
Damn you, Momo!

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.250
Work properly!

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.030
Come over here!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.500
One...

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:46.330
Two...

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.800
Three...

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.540
Umm, here.

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:56.970
If you'd like, have this drink!

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:59.210
O-Okay...

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:01.650
B-Bye...

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:07.400
Do you want to paint this wall together?

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:08.920
Hey, Shimojii.

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:11.230
Why are you working so hard for this?

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:12.830
You mean me?

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:14.280
Actually, a long time ago...

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:18.350
I was part of a student movement.

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:20.290
It had "youth" spelled all over it-

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:22.790
Hey, listen to me.

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:24.290
A bit to the right.

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:25.920
Yeah, to the right, right.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:27.440
Huh? Which way?

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:28.160
Right?

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.490
Is this good?

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:31.430
Not that way, the other way.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:32.880
Like, a bit over here?

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.100
Ah, too much, too much.

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:35.280
Manabi-chan.

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:37.780
It just came to me.

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:42.060
This is like a School Fair, right?

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:44.800
Yeah.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:16.320
Umm...

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:21.700
Did they get the 70% needed for the petition?

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:23.850
No.

00:21:33.110 --> 00:21:35.350
76%.

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:17.140
We're still at the very beginning of things.

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:23.860
Even the thousand-mile road starts with a first step.

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:30.820
There's a first time for everyone,

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:38.330
so take it on fearlessly - that's the best way to go

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:47.630
I'm glad I chose a path I love,

00:22:47.840 --> 00:22:54.850
so thank you, God.

